@startuml AppleNotesDataFlow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #4A148C
}

' Create Note Flow
rectangle "CREATE NOTE FLOW" as CreateFlow {
    entity User1 as "User"
    entity Frontend1 as "Frontend\n(Next.js)"
    entity API1 as "POST /notes\n(FastAPI)"
    entity Service1 as "NoteService"
    entity Repo1 as "NoteRepository"
    entity DB1 as "PostgreSQL\nINSERT"
    entity Response1 as "Response\n{note_id, ...}"
}

User1 --> Frontend1 : Types title + content
Frontend1 --> API1 : POST /notes\n{title, content, folder_id}
API1 --> Service1 : Validated request\n+ auth verified
Service1 --> Repo1 : create_note(user_id, ...)"
Repo1 --> DB1 : INSERT note row
DB1 --> Response1 : Returns note_id
Response1 --> Frontend1 : Auto-update note list
Frontend1 --> User1 : "Saved" indicator

note bottom of CreateFlow
    Total latency target: < 200ms (API)
    Immediate persistence: Database write before UI update
end note

' Search Flow
rectangle "SEARCH NOTES FLOW" as SearchFlow {
    entity User2 as "User"
    entity Frontend2 as "Frontend\n(Next.js)"
    entity API2 as "GET /search\n(FastAPI)"
    entity Service2 as "SearchService"
    entity DB2 as "PostgreSQL\nSELECT (full-text)"
    entity Response2 as "Response\n[{note_id, title, preview}]"
}

User2 --> Frontend2 : Types search query (debounced 150ms)
Frontend2 --> API2 : GET /search?q={query}\n&folder_id={X}
API2 --> Service2 : Validated query + auth
Service2 --> DB2 : SELECT * WHERE tsvector @@tsquery\nAND folder_id = X AND is_deleted = FALSE
DB2 --> Response2 : Results with match context
Response2 --> Frontend2 : Display filtered notes
Frontend2 --> User2 : Real-time results

note bottom of SearchFlow
    Target latency: < 500ms
    Debounce reduces DB load
    Full-text search uses PostgreSQL tsvector
end note

@enduml
